WEBVTT

1
00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:48.620
Ni kiumbe gani chenye nguvu zaidi?

2
00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:50.640
Bakteria?

3
00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.460
Virusi?

4
00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:54.900
Kipepeo wa utumbo?

5
00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:58.220
Ambayo Mr. Cobb anajaribu kusema.

6
00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.960
Ni wazo.

7
00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:03.560
Ni yenye kuhimili, yenye kuambukiza sana.

8
00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:05.600
Mara tu wazo limechukua akili,

9
00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:08.000
ni vigumu kuondoa.

10
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.640
Wazo ambalo limeundwa kabisa, limeeleweka kabisa,

11
00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:12.480
ambayo inanyenyekea.

12
00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.720
Hapo ndani popote.

13
00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:15.720
Kwa mtu kama wewe kuiba?

14
00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.000
Ndiyo, katika hali ya ndoto,

15
00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.640
ulinzi wako wa ufahamu hupungua

16
00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:21.400
na hufanya mawazo yako yawe hatarini kwa wizi.

17
00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.880
Inaitwa kuondoa.

18
00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:25.480
Hivyo, Saito, tunaweza kufundisha subconscious yako

19
00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:29.480
ili kujilinda hata dhidi ya mchimbaji stadi zaidi.

20
00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.720
Ninawezaje kufanya hivyo?

21
00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:33.890
Kwa sababu mimi ni mchimbaji stadi zaidi.

22
00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:36.410
Najua jinsi ya kuchunguza akili yako na kupata siri zako.

23
00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:38.530
Ninajua hila, na ninaweza kukufundisha

24
00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.270
ili hata wakati wewe ni usingizi,

25
00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:42.650
ulinzi wako kamwe chini.

26
00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:45.830
Tazama, kama unataka msaada wangu,

27
00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.610
utakuwa na kuwa wazi kabisa na mimi.

28
00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:49.370
Nahitaji kujua njia yangu ya kuzunguka mawazo yako

29
00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.690
bora kuliko mke wako,

30
00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:53.050
bora kuliko daktari wako, bora kuliko mtu yeyote.

31
00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:56.490
Kama hii ni ndoto na una hazina ya usalama kamili ya siri,

32
00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:59.290
Ninahitaji kujua nini ni katika hazina hiyo.

33
00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:00.770
Ili hii yote kazi,

34
00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:05.780
Lazima kabisa kuniruhusu kuingia.

35
00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:07.700
Furahia jioni yenu, wajumbe.

36
00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:09.540
Kama mimi kufikiria pendekezo lako.

37
00:04:09.540 --> 00:05:19.820
Fino ni katika hazina.

38
00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:23.700
Alitazama kwa makini nilipotaja siri.

39
00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:27.750
Anafanya nini sasa?

40
00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:29.030
Yeye ni kuelekea nyuma katika chumba.

41
00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:30.230
Sawa, mimi kutawala hili.

42
00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:31.190
Ok, hakikisha unafanya hivyo.

43
00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:40.990
Tuko hapa kufanya kazi.

44
00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:48.060
Ikiwa ningegeuka, je, ningeokoka?

45
00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:49.620
Huenda ni kupiga mbizi safi.

46
00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.180
Mama, unafanya nini hapa?

47
00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.940
Nilidhani huenda ukanipenda.

48
00:05:54.980 --> 00:06:00.730
Si kwamba mimi ni.

49
00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:03.660
Kwa hiyo, nini?

50
00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:06.060
Inaonekana wewe ni nje ya ladha yake.

51
00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.740
Kwa kweli, jambo hilo si la kweli

52
00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:11.340
kwa wasanii wa Uingereza wa baada ya vita.

53
00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:22.690
Tafadhali, kaa.

54
00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:34.430
Je, watoto walinikosa?

55
00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:35.670
Unafanya nini?

56
00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.670
Ni kupata hewa safi.

57
00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:39.150
Kaa mahali pako, Mama.

58
00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:24.860
Chukua bahasha, Mheshimiwa Cobb.

59
00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.740
Je, yeye aliiambia?

60
00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:28.740
Je, umejua tangu mwanzo?

61
00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:30.380
Je, wewe ni hapa kuiba kutoka kwangu,

62
00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:37.450
au kwamba kwa kweli tuko tukilala?

63
00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:44.100
Nataka kujua jina la mfanyakazi wako.

64
00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:46.340
Mimi ni katika ndoto, mama yangu.

65
00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:48.380
Hiyo inategemea nini wewe ni kutishia.

66
00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:51.380
Kumwua kungemfanya aamke.

67
00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:58.790
Lakini maumivu yako katika akili.

68
00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.670
Na kuhesabu kwa mapambo,

69
00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:16.490
sisi ni katika akili yako, sivyo, Arthur?

70
00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.330
Weka ngao yako!

71
00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.170
Najua.

72
00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:19.210
Ndoto huanguka.

73
00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:21.770
Jaribu kuweka Sator Wonder kidogo zaidi.

74
00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:22.770
Tumefika karibu.

75
00:09:22.770 --> 00:10:24.030
Hakuna kazi, amka.

76
00:10:24.030 --> 00:11:50.680
Mkuu wangu wa usalama anajua hili juu yangu.

77
00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:51.800
Aliipataje?

78
00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:54.680
Ni vigumu sana kwa mtu katika nafasi yako

79
00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.560
kuweka upendo kisu kama hii siri,

80
00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:59.000
hasa ambapo kuna mwanamke aliyeolewa kushiriki.

81
00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:00.000
Ni wewe na wao.

82
00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.200
Hata hivyo, hapa ndipo tulipo.

83
00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.200
Kwa ajili ya ugomvi.

84
00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.520
Wao ni karibu.

85
00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:05.920
Ulipata kile ulichokuja.

86
00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.560
- Si kweli.

87
00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:10.320
Ulikosa habari muhimu, sivyo?

88
00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:11.160
Ulikuwa unaficha kitu

89
00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.720
kwa sababu ulijua tulikuwa kufanya nini.

90
00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:15.680
Swali ni, kwa nini ulituacha tuingie?

91
00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:16.520
Mahojiano.

92
00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.640
Mahojiano kwa ajili ya nini?

93
00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:19.720
Si jambo muhimu.

94
00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:21.040
Wewe alishindwa.

95
00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:24.000
Tulichimba kila kitu ulicho nacho ndani.

96
00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.800
Lakini udanganyifu wako ulikuwa dhahiri.

97
00:13:16.500 --> 00:14:01.260
Haitaendelea kwa siku mbili.

98
00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:12.360
Sifa ya Mheshimiwa Carter.

99
00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:13.280
- Ulikuwaje?

100
00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.120
Si nzuri.

101
00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:24.930
Si ndoto, huh?

102
00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:28.690
Lakini katika ndoto yangu, wewe kucheza kwa sheria yangu.

103
00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:30.970
Ah, ndiyo, lakini unaona, Mheshimiwa Sator,

104
00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.370
sisi si katika ndoto yako.

105
00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:33.210
Sisi ni katika yangu.

106
00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:34.450
Mkubwa wazimu.

107
00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:45.050
Jinsi gani yeye kuchanganyikiwa carpet?

108
00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.250
Ilikuwa si kosa langu.

109
00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.570
Wewe ni mbunifu.

110
00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.610
Sikujua alikuwa kwenda rub yake ya kusikitisha kisigino juu yake.

111
00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:50.450
Hiyo ni kutosha.

112
00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:54.450
Wewe, nini kwa kweli ilikuwa yote hayo?

113
00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.690
Ninaweza kudhibiti.

114
00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:57.370
Ningependa kukuona ukipoteza udhibiti.

115
00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.570
Hatuna wakati wa hili.

116
00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:01.370
Mimi ni kushuka katika Kyoto.

117
00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:03.410
Kwa nini, yeye si kwenda kuangalia kila compartment?

118
00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:04.970
Naam, mimi sipendi treni.

119
00:15:04.970 --> 00:15:07.610
Sikiliza, kila mtu kwa ajili yake mwenyewe.

120
00:15:07.610 --> 00:16:23.220
Ndiyo, hello?

121
00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:28.300
Hey, guys, hey.

122
00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:30.140
Jinsi gani, jinsi gani wewe kufanya?

123
00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:34.140
- Ni sawa.

124
00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:36.260
Ilikuwa sawa tu.

125
00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:37.460
Je, ni wewe, Jane?

126
00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:44.100
Siwezi, chumba, siwezi.

127
00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.980
Si kwa muda, kumbuka?

128
00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:53.770
Nilikwambia mimi ni mbali kwa sababu mimi ni kazi, sawa?

129
00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:59.510
Phillipa, je, ni wewe?

130
00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:03.300
Weka nyanya kwenye simu kwa ajili yangu, unaweza?

131
00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:09.440
Naam, natumaini tu kwamba yeye ni makosa kuhusu hilo.

132
00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:19.890
Ndiyo, Jane, si hii.

133
00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:23.820
Mama hayupo tena.

134
00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:34.000
Sikiliza, mimi nitatuma zawadi kwa babu, sawa?

135
00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:35.600
Na uwe mzuri.

136
00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:46.650
Fimbo yetu iko juu ya paa.

137
00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:55.460
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

138
00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:57.100
Hey, wewe ni vizuri?

139
00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.580
Ndiyo, mimi ni vizuri, kwa nini?

140
00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:01.460
Naam, chini katika ndoto, mimi wote kuonekana.

141
00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:02.300
Karibu, Mama.

142
00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:04.580
Samahani kwa mguu wako, haitatokea tena.

143
00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:05.740
Ni mbaya zaidi, sivyo?

144
00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:08.380
Unaomba msamaha mmoja tu, sawa, Arthur?

145
00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:09.220
Je, si wewe?

146
00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:11.140
Yeye si kuonyesha, unataka kusubiri?

147
00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:13.540
La, tunapaswa kutoa mipango ya upanuzi wa Saito

148
00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:15.180
Cobol Engineering saa mbili zilizopita.

149
00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:17.060
Sasa wanajua tumeshindwa.

150
00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:18.420
Ni wakati wa sisi kutoweka.

151
00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:20.820
Utakwenda wapi?

152
00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:21.980
Bueno, Saris.

153
00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:23.980
Naweza kulala chini huko, labda kupata kazi

154
00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:25.820
na mambo ya utulivu.

155
00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:26.660
Wewe?

156
00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:27.860
Kaa karibu.

157
00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:35.700
Tuma salamu zangu.

158
00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.820
Aliona sanaa, alifikiri kuja kwangu

159
00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:41.060
Na akafanya biashara kwa ajili ya maisha yake.

160
00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:47.110
Kwa hiyo, nakupa uradhi.

161
00:18:47.110 --> 00:19:01.720
Siyo njia yangu ya kushughulikia mambo.

162
00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:03.560
Utafanya nini nayo?

163
00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:07.800
Hakuna kitu, lakini siwezi kuzungumza kwa ajili ya Cobol Engineering.

164
00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:24.440
Unataka nini kutoka kwetu?

165
00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:29.290
Kuanza.

166
00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:31.610
Kama unaweza kuiba wazo kutoka akili ya mtu,

167
00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:33.650
kwa nini huwezi kupanga siku moja badala yake?

168
00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:36.010
Sawa, hapa mimi ni mipango wazo katika akili yako.

169
00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:38.290
Mimi kukuambia, kufikiri juu ya tembo.

170
00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:39.770
Unafikiria nini?

171
00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:40.610
Tembo.

172
00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.050
Ni kweli, lakini si wazo lako

173
00:19:42.050 --> 00:19:44.050
kwa sababu unajua mimi nilikupa.

174
00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:45.810
Akili ya mtu anaweza daima kufuatilia

175
00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.170
Mwanzo wa wazo.

176
00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:49.010
Uvutio wa kweli hauwezi kufanywa.

177
00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:53.910
Si kweli.

178
00:19:53.910 --> 00:19:55.430
Je, unanipa uchaguzi?

179
00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:57.550
Kwa sababu ninaweza kupata njia yangu mwenyewe

180
00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.950
kutapika mambo na Cobol.

181
00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:01.230
Basi una uchaguzi.

182
00:20:01.230 --> 00:20:08.140
Na mimi kuchagua kuondoka, bwana.

183
00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:15.020
Waambie wafanyakazi wapi unataka kwenda.

184
00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:20.520
Hey, Mheshimiwa Cobb, je, ungependa kwenda nyumbani?

185
00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:22.760
Kwa Marekani?

186
00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:24.680
Kwa watoto wako?

187
00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.720
Siwezi kurekebisha hilo.

188
00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.320
Hakuna anayeweza.

189
00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:30.920
Kama vile Mwanzo.

190
00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:36.300
Cobb, hebu.

191
00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:37.980
Hilo ni wazo gumu kadiri gani?

192
00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:39.220
Rahisi ya kutosha.

193
00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:40.620
Hakuna wazo rahisi

194
00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:43.300
wakati unahitaji kuiweka katika akili ya mtu mwingine.

195
00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:46.980
Mshindani wangu mkuu ni mzee mwenye afya mbaya.

196
00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:50.060
Hivi karibuni mwanawe atairithi kampuni hiyo.

197
00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:54.980
Ninahitaji yeye kuamua kuvunja ufalme wa baba yake.

198
00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.340
Cobb, tunapaswa kuondoka katika hili.

199
00:20:57.340 --> 00:21:00.660
Subiri kidogo.

200
00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:02.180
Kama ningefanya hili,

201
00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:04.020
kama ningeweza hata kufanya hivyo,

202
00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:06.180
Ninahitaji dhamana.

203
00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:07.820
Ninajuaje kwamba unaweza kutoa?

204
00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:08.660
Wewe si.

205
00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:10.900
Lakini ninaweza.

206
00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:12.820
Kwa hiyo,

207
00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:15.820
Je, unataka kuchukua hatua ya imani

208
00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:18.300
au kuwa mzee

209
00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:26.760
ukiwa na huzuni, ukingojea kufa peke yako?

210
00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.800
Kuunganisha timu yako, Bwana Cobb,

211
00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:39.500
Na uwachague watu wako kwa hekima zaidi.

212
00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:43.910
Tazama, najua jinsi unataka kwenda nyumbani.

213
00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:44.910
Haiwezekani kufanya hivyo.

214
00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:46.670
Ndiyo, inaweza.

215
00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:49.070
Mimi tu lazima kwenda kina kutosha.

216
00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:52.060
Hujui hilo.

217
00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:55.260
Nimefanya hivyo kabla.

218
00:21:55.260 --> 00:22:01.940
Ungefanya nini?

219
00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:05.400
Nenda Paris.

220
00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:23.700
Tutahitaji mbuni mpya.

221
00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:27.670
Hujawahi kupenda ofisi yako, je?

222
00:22:27.670 --> 00:22:32.460
Hakuna nafasi ya kufikiri katika kabati hilo la kitambaa.

223
00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:36.140
Je, ni salama kwako kuwa hapa?

224
00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:38.380
Utoaji kati ya Ufaransa na Marekani

225
00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:40.460
ni ndoto mbaya ya kiutawala, unajua hilo?

226
00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:41.620
Nadhani wanaweza kupata njia

227
00:22:41.620 --> 00:22:43.420
ili kufanya kazi katika kesi yako.

228
00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:47.580
Tazama, mimi alileta haya kwa ajili yako kutoa kwa watoto

229
00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:48.620
wakati una nafasi.

230
00:22:48.620 --> 00:22:51.180
Itakuwa kuchukua zaidi ya mara kwa mara stuffed wanyama

231
00:22:51.180 --> 00:22:54.380
ili kuwasadikisha watoto hao kwamba bado wana baba.

232
00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:55.380
Mimi tu kufanya nini najua.

233
00:22:55.380 --> 00:22:57.540
Mimi kufanya nini wewe nilifundisha.

234
00:22:57.540 --> 00:22:59.140
Sikuwahi kukufundisha kuwa mwizi.

235
00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:01.460
Hapana, ulinifundisha kuongoza akili za watu,

236
00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:02.980
lakini baada ya kile kilichotokea,

237
00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:04.660
hakukuwa na mengi ya njia halali

238
