Mara tu muziki wa Arthur utakapofanya kazi,

1614
01:53:59.790 --> 01:54:01.470
tu kutumia defibrillator kumfufua.

1615
01:54:01.470 --> 01:54:05.470
Tunaweza kumpiga mwenyewe chini.

1616
01:54:05.470 --> 01:54:07.230
Tazama, kumpeleka huko.

1617
01:54:07.230 --> 01:54:10.110
Mara tu muziki unapoisha, wewe kupasua hospitali,

1618
01:54:10.110 --> 01:54:14.330
na sisi wote kupanda kick nyuma juu ya kambi.

1619
01:54:14.330 --> 01:54:16.290
Naam, ni thamani ya kujaribu.

1620
01:54:16.290 --> 01:54:19.250
Kama Saito anaweza kuweka walinzi juu wakati mimi kuweka mashtaka.

1621
01:54:19.250 --> 01:54:23.230
Saito hataweza kufanikiwa, sivyo?

1622
01:54:23.230 --> 01:54:25.150
Lazima tujaribu hii.

1623
01:54:25.150 --> 01:54:26.510
Fanya hivyo.

1624
01:54:26.510 --> 01:54:27.670
Kama wewe si kurudi kabla ya kick,

1625
01:54:27.670 --> 01:54:28.870
Mimi ni kwenda na au bila wewe.

1626
01:54:28.870 --> 01:54:29.870
Yeye ni haki.

1627
01:54:36.780 --> 01:54:38.420
Ninaamini wewe kufanya nini inahitaji kutokea hapa.

1628
01:54:38.420 --> 01:54:40.300
Namaanisha, Mal atakuwa chini.

1629
01:54:40.300 --> 01:54:41.700
Najua wapi kupata yake.

1630
01:54:41.700 --> 01:54:42.580
Yeye atakuwa na Fisher.

1631
01:54:42.580 --> 01:54:43.500
Unajuaje?

1632
01:54:43.500 --> 01:54:46.900
Kwa sababu anataka niende kumfuata.

1633
01:54:46.900 --> 01:54:48.940
Anataka nirudi chini pamoja naye.

1634
01:54:48.940 --> 01:55:25.850
Je, umefariki?

1635
01:55:25.850 --> 01:55:27.690
- Ni nini?

1636
01:55:27.690 --> 01:56:23.850
Hapa ndipo atakuwa, kutunza Fisher

1637
01:56:23.850 --> 01:56:25.290
wakati mimi kwenda kuweka baadhi ya mashtaka, OK?

1638
01:56:25.290 --> 01:56:27.210
Hakuna nafasi kwa ajili ya watalii juu yangu.

1639
01:56:27.210 --> 01:58:07.480
Kuanza katika kumbukumbu.

1640
01:58:07.480 --> 01:58:09.640
Ilikuwa nyumba yao ya kwanza.

1641
01:58:09.640 --> 01:58:11.960
Na tukahamia kwenye jengo hilo.

1642
01:58:11.960 --> 01:58:14.640
Baada ya Mal kupata mimba, hiyo ikawa nyumba yetu.

1643
01:58:14.640 --> 01:58:17.640
Ulitengeneza yote haya kutoka kumbukumbu?

1644
01:58:17.640 --> 01:58:20.080
Kama nilivyokwambia, tulikuwa na muda mwingi.

1645
01:58:20.080 --> 01:58:23.100
Ni nini hicho?

1646
01:58:23.100 --> 01:58:24.980
Ni nyumba Mal alikua katika.

1647
01:58:24.980 --> 01:58:27.920
Je, atakuwa ndani?

1648
01:58:27.920 --> 01:58:29.040
Hebu tufanye hivyo.

1649
01:58:29.040 --> 01:58:30.480
Sote tulitaka kuishi katika nyumba,

1650
01:58:30.480 --> 01:58:32.080
lakini tunapenda aina hii ya jengo.

1651
01:58:32.080 --> 01:58:35.040
Katika ulimwengu wa kweli, tungelazimika kuchagua, lakini si hapa.

1652
01:58:35.040 --> 01:59:17.790
Mlete Fisher nyuma.

1653
01:59:17.790 --> 01:59:24.860
Mal kuweka aina fulani ya improvise.

1654
01:59:24.860 --> 01:59:27.660
Sikiliza, kuna kitu unapaswa kujua kuhusu mimi,

1655
01:59:27.660 --> 01:59:29.020
kuhusu mwanzo.

1656
01:59:29.020 --> 01:59:48.750
Wazo ni kama virusi, vinaweza kuambukizwa sana.

1657
01:59:48.750 --> 01:59:51.950
Na mbegu ndogo zaidi ya wazo inaweza kukua.

1658
01:59:52.030 --> 01:59:57.740
Je, litakufautisha au kukuharibu?

1659
01:59:57.740 --> 02:00:06.020
Wazo dogo zaidi, kama vile, ulimwengu wako si halisi.

1660
02:00:07.140 --> 02:00:12.100
Wazo dogo rahisi ambalo hubadilisha kila kitu.

1661
02:00:12.100 --> 02:00:15.700
Ni hakika sana kuhusu ulimwengu wako, kuhusu kile kilicho halisi.

1662
02:00:16.580 --> 02:00:17.540
Je, unafikiri ni hivyo?

1663
02:00:20.180 --> 02:00:22.340
Au unafikiri yeye ni kama mimi?

1664
02:00:24.180 --> 02:00:25.380
Najua nini ni halisi, Mal.

1665
02:00:27.940 --> 02:00:29.620
Hakuna shaka yoyote.

1666
02:00:30.500 --> 02:00:32.660
Si kujisikia kuteswa, mpumbavu.

1667
02:00:33.460 --> 02:00:37.700
Walifuatwa ulimwenguni pote na makampuni yasiyojulikana na majeshi ya polisi.

1668
02:00:37.700 --> 02:00:40.340
Jinsi maono yanavyomwudhi mtarajia.

1669
02:00:40.340 --> 02:00:43.040
Kukubali.

1670
02:00:43.040 --> 02:00:47.040
Siamini katika ukweli mmoja tena.

1671
02:00:47.840 --> 02:00:48.960
Kwa hiyo chagua.

1672
02:00:49.760 --> 02:00:51.040
Chagua kuwa hapa.

1673
02:00:52.320 --> 02:00:53.120
Chagua mimi.

1674
02:00:53.840 --> 02:01:27.310
Wewe ni makosa.

1675
02:01:28.190 --> 02:01:28.830
Si vibaya.

1676
02:01:28.830 --> 02:01:30.030
Wewe ni kuchanganyikiwa.

1677
02:01:31.870 --> 02:01:33.630
Watoto wetu wako hapa.

1678
02:01:33.630 --> 02:01:41.090
Juu, Mal.

1679
02:01:58.260 --> 02:01:59.380
Sikiliza mwenyewe.

1680
02:02:00.020 --> 02:02:01.620
Hao ni watoto wetu.

1681
02:02:04.350 --> 02:02:05.630
James, Philippa.

1682
02:02:07.150 --> 02:02:08.990
Tafadhali, hao si watoto wangu.

1683
02:02:08.990 --> 02:02:11.390
Unaendelea kujiambia hivyo, lakini huamini.

1684
02:02:11.390 --> 02:02:12.110
Hapana, najua.

1685
02:02:12.110 --> 02:02:12.990
Na vipi ikiwa una makosa?

1686
02:02:13.550 --> 02:02:15.470
Vipi kama mimi ni halisi?

1687
02:02:17.070 --> 02:02:24.140
Unaendelea kujiambia yale unayoyajua, lakini unaamini nini?

1688
02:02:24.140 --> 02:02:25.660
Unajisikiaje?

1689
02:02:25.660 --> 02:02:38.780
Sina tumaini.

1690
02:02:38.780 --> 02:02:52.770
Hisia ya hatia ambayo ilifanya uone ukweli wako kuwa wa kweli ilitoka kwangu.

1691
02:02:56.800 --> 02:02:59.440
Ulimwekea wazo hilo akilini mwangu.

1692
02:02:59.440 --> 02:03:02.660
Anazungumza juu ya nini?

1693
02:03:03.860 --> 02:03:08.500
Sababu nilijua kwamba Kuanza Kuwezekana ni kwa sababu nilimfanyia kwanza.

1694
02:03:08.500 --> 02:03:20.060
Tulipotea hapa na kukubaliwa.

1695
02:03:24.060 --> 02:03:25.660
Alikuwa amefunga kitu fulani.

1696
02:03:25.660 --> 02:03:26.460
Kitu fulani.

1697
02:03:26.460 --> 02:03:33.900
Ukweli ambao alijua wakati mmoja, lakini akachagua kusahau.

1698
02:03:40.640 --> 02:03:48.080
Hivyo nikaamua kumtafuta katika sehemu za ndani za akili yake na nikapata mahali hapo pa siri.

1699
02:03:48.960 --> 02:03:57.650
Usiku uliingia, wazo, kila kitu.

1700
02:03:57.650 --> 02:04:05.150
Ulimwengu wake haukuwa halisi.

1701
02:04:05.150 --> 02:04:30.460
Kusubiri kwa treni.

1702
02:04:30.460 --> 02:04:34.830
Wewe ni mbali.

1703
02:04:37.120 --> 02:04:42.430
Unajua mahali ambapo unatumaini treni hii itakupeleka, lakini huwezi kujua kwa uhakika.

1704
02:04:44.350 --> 02:04:45.390
Na si jambo muhimu.

1705
02:04:47.310 --> 02:04:48.590
Sasa niambie kwa nini.

1706
02:04:48.590 --> 02:04:50.750
Kwa sababu mlifanya hivyo pamoja.

1707
02:04:50.750 --> 02:04:59.200
Wazo hilo lingekua akilini mwake kama kansa.

1708
02:04:59.200 --> 02:05:20.210
Kwamba hata baada ya yeye kuamka, ulimwengu hakuwa halisi katika kutoroka.

1709
02:05:20.210 --> 02:05:21.250
Yesu, Yesu!

1710
02:05:21.330 --> 02:05:23.490
Wewe ni kuambukiza akili yangu.

1711
02:05:23.490 --> 02:05:24.770
Nilijaribu kukuokoa.

1712
02:05:24.770 --> 02:05:25.890
Umenichukia.

1713
02:05:27.170 --> 02:05:28.770
Lakini unaweza kufanya marekebisho.

1714
02:05:28.770 --> 02:05:30.850
Bado unaweza kutimiza ahadi yako.

1715
02:05:30.850 --> 02:05:36.450
Bado tunaweza kuwa pamoja hapa katika ulimwengu tuliojenga pamoja.

1716
02:05:36.450 --> 02:07:11.760
Fisher ni juu ya njia.

1717
02:07:11.760 --> 02:07:15.900
Siwezi kufanya hivyo.

1718
02:07:15.900 --> 02:07:17.660
Nenda kuangalia yeye ni hai sasa hivi.

1719
02:07:17.660 --> 02:07:18.160
Fanya hivyo.

1720
02:07:37.730 --> 02:07:39.250
Chukua Fisher pamoja nawe, sawa?

1721
02:07:39.250 --> 02:07:41.170
Huwezi kukaa hapa kuwa na yeye.

1722
02:07:43.860 --> 02:07:44.360
Sijui.

1723
02:07:45.300 --> 02:07:46.500
Saito amekufa kwa sasa.

1724
02:07:46.500 --> 02:07:48.500
Hiyo ina maana yeye ni hapa chini mahali fulani.

1725
02:07:48.500 --> 02:07:52.160
Hiyo ina maana lazima nipate.

1726
02:07:52.160 --> 02:07:54.880
Siwezi kukaa naye tena kwa sababu yeye haipo.

1727
02:07:55.520 --> 02:07:56.960
Mimi ni jambo moja tu unafanya.

1728
02:07:56.960 --> 02:08:23.150
Ni kivuli cha maisha yangu halisi.

1729
02:08:24.190 --> 02:08:29.620
Wewe kukumbuka bora kwamba naweza kufanya, lakini wewe ni tu si nzuri ya kutosha.

1730
02:08:34.370 --> 02:08:35.090
Unafanya nini?

1731
02:08:36.290 --> 02:08:36.850
Fanya mazoezi.

1732
02:08:49.140 --> 02:08:49.940
Nenda, nenda, nenda, nenda.

1733
02:09:58.320 --> 02:14:54.030
Ili tu kuishi kwa ajili yake.

1734
02:14:54.030 --> 02:15:11.100
Hiyo ni nini nitakuwa kufanya, Uncle Peter.

1735
02:15:11.100 --> 02:15:11.900
Na mama?

1736
02:15:11.900 --> 02:15:13.260
Si nzuri sid.

1737
02:15:13.260 --> 02:15:16.290
Yeye atakuwa amepotea.

1738
02:15:19.840 --> 02:15:20.640
Hapana, atakuwa sawa.

